* Registry identities with history and versions; cognitive_kernel digest (IR contracts, MRDL ops
  and caps, registry); pinned program records replay under their historical registry; migration
  adapters accepted only if they reproduce the old semantics; mining of repeated DEV trace shapes.
* Starting set (builder-written): EdgeCount, TriangleCount, SumDegreeSquares, PairCodegreeFalling2.
* tests: test_primitives (12).

