Subject: [PATCH 06/11] B20_R13 setup: graph-construction headroom pilot for
 GV4 (rules fixed before running)

The user chose graph construction as the GV4 domain on 13 Oct 2026. Restored from the session log
after a workspace loss (the original setup commit 810c39e is lost with B20_R12). The settings, solver
space, improvers, references and verdict rule are unchanged; only e1_exposure() now computes the
E1 host lists itself (B19 pilot, B20_R11 pilot and rehearsal, B20_R12 pilot: 145 hosts) instead of
importing the B20_R12 script. handoff/e1/exposure_hosts_to_exclude.json is byte-identical to
